    {
      "id": "note-classes",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": {
        "x": -580,
        "y": 660
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "WorldCover class reference",
        "params": {
          "text": "## WorldCover classes used (4-class model)\n\n| Value | Label | Note |\n|-------|-------|------|\n| **95** | CoastalVeg | 90+95 merged (class_merge=90=95) |\n| **10** | Tree cover | inland forest |\n| **80** | Permanent water | river / estuary |\n| **60** | Bare/sparse | orpaillage, river bars |\n\n**`include_classes`**: `10,60,80,95`\n**`class_merge`**: `90=95` (WC has ~15% label error at 90/95 boundary)\n**`split_mode`**: Spatial blocks (50 px ≈ 1 km) — avoids spatial autocorrelation bias.",
          "width": 440,
          "height": 260,
          "fontSize": 11,
          "color_index": 6
        }
      },
      "width": 512,
      "height": 265,
      "selected": false,
      "positionAbsolute": {
        "x": -580,
        "y": 660
      },
      "dragging": false
    },
